id=fox_live_fps
name=Live FPS HUD
version=v2.2.0
versionCode=20200
author=Fox
description=[ Tap Action to toggle | open WebUI to configure ] Draws a live FPS counter straight into WindowManager from a root process - no app to install, no draw-over-other-apps permission. Reads the panel fps node on Snapdragon (sde-crtc measured_fps) and falls back to a vsync counter on any other device.
